WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
Automations: Repeatable work runs itself, within your limits.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:10.153
Overview: what runs on its own, what is coming up, and what waits for your approval.

3
00:00:10.153 --> 00:00:14.701
Scheduler: switch published campaigns on and off at set times, even when you are offline.

4
00:00:14.701 --> 00:00:19.365
Rules: watch spend, cost per result or ROAS, then notify you, ask first, or act within limits.

5
00:00:19.365 --> 00:00:26.149
Activity: a record of every run. Nothing acts without a schedule or rule you switched on.
